/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ wheels ---------------------------------- */

/**
 * A wheel as one mesh about x through its hub: the tyre (its tread, shoulders and sidewalls as a lathe) and its steel
 * disc rim, coloured by vertex (tyre near black, the rim its own colour, both browned by the road). `dual` sets two
